Viktor 10.10.2026: «Артиста по модели InvokeAI постарайся на максимум вывести со всем возможным ахуем».

The Artist's form has a reference picture under the prompt: dropped on its place, pasted in the room (Ctrl+V), chosen from a file (PNG, JPEG or WebP, 40 MB at most), or the stage's picture taken with its new «As reference»; with it «How much it may change» (0.2 to 1.0, kept in this browser: 0.3 keeps the picture nearly as it is, 0.6 its composition with its matter changed, 0.9 the prompt's scene in its light and colours), and ✕ to paint from the noise again. Draw sends it (a data URL, or the run and the picture it is); «Again» paints from the run's own; the stage says «from a reference · 0.76». The Artist room stays English in every language until the pass before 2.0.0. Lab 1305 does the painting (Krea 2's VAE, the strength's sigma, the tail of the sigmas).

Suite: 555/0 in the kitchen; pictures of the form by day by tools/claude-ref-probe.mjs (the empty words hid only once their flex gave way to [hidden]).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
